{"meta":{"id":"static","category":"it/syntax/typescript/class","title":"static 멤버 · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"객체 없이 클래스 이름으로 사용하는 멤버 — 유틸, 상수, 싱글톤","tags":["typescript","f-class","f-static"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">static 멤버 · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 객체 없이 클래스 이름으로 사용하는 멤버 — 유틸, 상수, 싱글톤</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">static — 객체 없이 사용하는 멤버</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class MathUtil {\r\n  static readonly PI = 3.14;\r\n\r\n  static circle(r: number) {\r\n    return MathUtil.PI * r * r;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nMathUtil.circle(2);      // new 없이 클래스 이름으로 호출\r\n// new MathUtil().circle // 오류: 인스턴스에는 없음</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">인스턴스마다가 아니라 <strong>클래스에 하나</strong>만 존재한다. 유틸 함수, 상수, 카운터에 사용</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">싱글톤 · 인스턴스 개수</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class Db {\r\n  private static instance: Db;\r\n  static count = 0;\r\n\r\n  private constructor() { Db.count++; }\r\n\r\n  static get() {\r\n    return (Db.instance ??= new Db());\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nDb.get() === Db.get();   // true</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">주의</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">static 메서드 안의 <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>this</code> 는 인스턴스가 아니라 클래스 자체</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">static 멤버에서는 인스턴스 속성에 접근할 수 없음</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-violet-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>static { … }</code> 블록으로 클래스 초기화 코드 작성 가능 (ES2022)</span></div></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/class/static","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/typescript/class"}],"hasImage":false}